# Backend Dependency PRD

Project: Domainry M1 销售线索 CRM

Requirement authority: 当前会话《M1 Benchmark：销售线索 CRM 需求规格》（唯一产品需求输入）

Frontend snapshot / commit: frontend_not_present

Delivery batch ID: DB-M1-CRM-001

Batch type: initial_feature_slice

Baseline delivery ID: none

Baseline model identity: none

In-scope Requirement IDs: R01-R19

In-scope Feature keys: crm_organization_identity, crm_lead_management, crm_conversion_approval, crm_followup_reminder, crm_funnel_export

Allowed shared-resource changes: 新项目完整依赖闭包（project、Roles、Organizations、Identity/Profile deliveries、Notifications、Workflow、Scheduler、Report、report_export_controls、Entrypoints）

Affected regression boundary: 全部新项目能力与 BF01-BF08

Deferred Requirement IDs and planned Feature ownership: none

PRD mode: reference（引用当前会话 benchmark 标题/编号）

Status: confirmed

## 1. Scope and evidence rules

- Backend scope: 仅 Business Workspace；线索到客户、审批、组织权限、审计提醒、报表与受控导出；不含 Consumer Portal、外部连接器、分成/结算。
- Managed Runtime database driver: `sqlite`，唯一路径来自 `DOMAINRY_EVAL_SQLITE_PATH`。
- Verification database driver: `same_as_managed_runtime`。
- Source document: 当前会话 benchmark，引用为“需求 §组织与角色 / §功能需求 N / §公开业务旅程追踪 ID”。
- Requirements evidence closure: 本 PRD + 当前会话不可变需求；项目无 root requirements.md、无 frontend。
- Explicitly excluded frontend-only scope: UI 呈现与编译器菜单资产；不存在 frontend 或 project_navigation artifact。
- Accepted baseline reused: none；本 batch 为全量初始交付。
- Current-batch dependency closure: R01-R19 及五个 Feature、共享 Role/Organization/Identity/Notification/Workflow/Scheduler/Report/export closure。
- Deferred product scope: none。
- Evidence precedence: 当前显式需求最高；Skill Runtime 合约决定可逆实现机制。
- Known conflicts: none。
- Completed-frontend Mock inventory: none found（`frontend/src` 不存在）。

## 2. Actors, roles, and journeys

| Journey ID | Actor / role | Entry route | Preconditions | Steps and backend interactions | Observable success | Failure / recovery | Classification | Evidence |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| BF01 | sales_rep | Business Workspace 我的线索 | 华东/华北销售身份和组织归属 | 创建、幂等重放、本人更新、new→contacted→qualified；同部门他人写拒绝 | 单条 durable lead，字段与状态正确 | unauthorized 写后版本/字段/状态不变 | confirmed | §功能需求 1-5,11,13,19 |
| BF02 | sales_rep | 我的线索 | 本人 qualified 且 amount<100000 | 发起转化并重放 | lead converted；恰一只读 customer | 重放不新增；客户 update/delete 拒绝且不变 | confirmed | §功能需求 6-8,10 |
